    "pt": "<header class=\"rv-abre\"><span class=\"rv-num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">G</span><div><p class=\"rv-kicker\">Apêndice G</p><p class=\"rv-tit\">De onde vem tudo isto</p></div></header>\n<p>Este detonado nasceu da leitura de quatro fontes, e os dados foram cruzados entre elas:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Walkthrough da GameFAQs</b>, de Devin Morgan (2010): <a href=\"https://gamefaqs.gamespot.com/nes/570611-famicom-jump-ii-saikyou-no-7-nin/faqs\" rel=\"noopener\">página de guias do Famicom Jump II</a>.</li>\n<li><b>Detonado japonês do lucifer</b>: <a href=\"http://lucifer.s14.xrea.com/x/hobby/fcjump2/top.htm\" rel=\"noopener\">lucifer.s14.xrea.com</a>.</li>\n<li><b>ゲームカタログ@Wiki</b>, a página do jogo.</li>\n<li><b>Manual original do cartucho</b> (Bandai, 1991), que a Nintendo republicou <a href=\"https://www.nintendo.co.jp/clvj/manuals/pdf/CLV-P-HBABJ.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\">em PDF</a>.</li>\n</ul>",
    "en": "<header class=\"rv-abre\"><span class=\"rv-num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">G</span><div><p class=\"rv-kicker\">Appendix G</p><p class=\"rv-tit\">Where all this comes from</p></div></header>\n<p>This walkthrough grew out of four sources, and the data were cross-checked between them:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><b>GameFAQs walkthrough</b>, by Devin Morgan (2010): <a href=\"https://gamefaqs.gamespot.com/nes/570611-famicom-jump-ii-saikyou-no-7-nin/faqs\" rel=\"noopener\">Famicom Jump II guides page</a>.</li>\n<li><b>Lucifer's Japanese walkthrough</b>: <a href=\"http://lucifer.s14.xrea.com/x/hobby/fcjump2/top.htm\" rel=\"noopener\">lucifer.s14.xrea.com</a>.</li>\n<li><b>ゲームカタログ@Wiki</b>, the game's page.</li>\n<li><b>Original cartridge manual</b> (Bandai, 1991), which Nintendo republished <a href=\"https://www.nintendo.co.jp/clvj/manuals/pdf/CLV-P-HBABJ.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\">as a PDF</a>.</li>\n</ul>",
    "es": "<header class=\"rv-abre\"><span class=\"rv-num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">G</span><div><p class=\"rv-kicker\">Apéndice G</p><p class=\"rv-tit\">De dónde sale todo esto</p></div></header>\n<p>Esta guía nació de la lectura de cuatro fuentes, y los datos se cruzaron entre ellas:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Walkthrough de GameFAQs</b>, de Devin Morgan (2010): <a href=\"https://gamefaqs.gamespot.com/nes/570611-famicom-jump-ii-saikyou-no-7-nin/faqs\" rel=\"noopener\">página de guías del Famicom Jump II</a>.</li>\n<li><b>Guía japonesa de lucifer</b>: <a href=\"http://lucifer.s14.xrea.com/x/hobby/fcjump2/top.htm\" rel=\"noopener\">lucifer.s14.xrea.com</a>.</li>\n<li><b>ゲームカタログ@Wiki</b>, la página del juego.</li>\n<li><b>Manual original del cartucho</b> (Bandai, 1991), que Nintendo republicó <a href=\"https://www.nintendo.co.jp/clvj/manuals/pdf/CLV-P-HBABJ.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\">en PDF</a>.</li>\n</ul>"
